0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pum2SVFiiIIQ7kNvwEcOpKd&_nc_oc=AdrQHU9kwU2QyNQ5-U9Gdam8wCEUVpTkWNAmi6smpNn-VsmxsOndQ3GQPrCSsXY0jog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afyzh1Lu1Vuhi3a_VGhTU6Xyj945nOYfs6a0yyJJlN9n_w&oe=69C67456"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nMwX7en5Y_oQ7kNvwGY6HUX&_nc_oc=Adp1HBoUDjfE8s4UgeJ0uJTJcw2S2CZesf2xiNB1NCX6TsVk4dzOZ-9I9J_rPPgrq2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyHkWLYzwwQiayFIcJr0e8shb62PQmhe9A8d9jI45_R3Q&oe=69C67E2D"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VKrUz-4HWLYQ7kNvwH2cloa&_nc_oc=AdqfyymCi4BS9M65UU7vpf0UhKo5-pV2sd6DqQmmIV5CjFWsXz_dyFeYaXwPTqNUYJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzKQipBVaXRDcdQYn2jvMnlsQ4tcImM4OlWxA4-2Ci0bg&oe=69C6766D"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_cat=100&